  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds read on empty SOAP-ENC:arraySize\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-15353.patch: out-of-bounds read on empty SOAP-ENC:arraySize\n     - CVE-2026-15353\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: SOAP DTD use-after-free during cleanup\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129506.patch: SOAP DTD use-after-free during cleanup\n     - CVE-2026-129506\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: TLS downgrade for mixed case HTTPS and FTPS URLs\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-128064.patch: TLS downgrade for mixed case HTTPS and FTPS URLs\n     - CVE-2026-128064\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: PATH_INFO underflow in CGI init_request_info()\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129538.patch: PATH_INFO underflow in CGI init_request_info()\n     - CVE-2026-129538\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: code execution via corrupted session file\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-126714.patch: code execution via corrupted session file\n     - CVE-2026-126714\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: FPM worker stdio pipe fd closed twice\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129291.patch: FPM worker stdio pipe fd closed twice\n     - CVE-2026-129291\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: unread request body parsed as a new FastCGI request\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129289.patch: unread request body parsed as a new FastCGI request\n     - CVE-2026-129289\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: DATEG(tzcache) use-after-free when logging errors\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129496.patch: DATEG(tzcache) use-after-free when logging errors\n     - CVE-2026-129496\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in backtraces of __call trampoline frames\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129474.patch: use-after-free in backtraces of __call trampoline frames\n     - CVE-2026-129474\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: phar OpenSSL signature downgrade to a keyless hash\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-128090.patch: phar OpenSSL signature downgrade to a keyless hash\n     - CVE-2026-128090\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: quadratic folded HTTP response header concatenation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-127960.patch: quadratic folded HTTP response header concatenation\n     - CVE-2026-127960\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: FPM status page XSS via method, user and script\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-129292.patch: FPM status page XSS via method, user and script\n     - CVE-2026-129292",
